/code-review high — loop R1, round 1 — range 554a7d40..6ef2794c (branch 2026-10-08-execute-renders-served-at-a-url)

I found 10 issues in the branch delta 554a7d40..6ef2794c (`docs/plans/` excluded). As the high-effort recipe specifies, none was re-verified after dedup.

- **Most serious:** renders are filed by route folder, so after a route change an old image can show up as a different screen's render (first finding). The `RENDER:` line also carries no project, so the per-project copy can file images under the wrong project.
- **Contract gap:** `stack-adapter.md` accepts any image file, but `renders.mjs` only copies PNGs.
- **Docs:** `site/` and `readme.md` don't mention renders mode or the kept renders yet. I left that out because the plan gives it to unit U5 in wave 3.

